Recommended Architecture for Java 21

For 9–20 third-party APIs, my recommendation is:

Option 1 (Most Enterprise-Friendly)

                  Java 21 Virtual Threads
                  +
                  CompletableFuture
                  +
                  Resilience4j
                  +
                  Redis Cache

Advantages:

Easier debugging
Easier maintenance
Excellent performance
Minimal learning curve


============================================================================
Option 2 (Highest Throughput)

              Spring WebFlux
              +
              WebClient
              +
              Reactor
              +
              Resilience4j

Advantages:

    Maximum scalability
    Lowest memory usage
    Best for thousands of concurrent requests



================================================================================

